{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"怡和大廈兩工人被困半空　消防員救起\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FALL-CENTRAL-261026-21.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】中環有吊船發生意外，兩名工人被困半空，由消防員救起。</p><p>現場是中環怡和大廈，約下午六時許，兩名工人乘坐吊船進行高空工作期間，吊船懷疑發生故障，兩人被困於30至40層的外牆，消防員遊繩營救，據報兩名工人均手部受傷，清醒送往瑪麗醫院治理。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:12:13.550267+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:07:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T04:18:33.700174+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:39.395582+00:00","content_hash":"08600bf115583357e894b97f49d0cb2631f0a895fce67f2d9009393e7db157be","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}